 opens the ration screen\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-8.4\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The candidate is displayed without being shown as a saved ration, and the unauthorized user's screen displays existing rations without create, revise, optimize, or approve actions\",\n     \"when\": \"The screen renders\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The optimization response indicates that no candidate mix meets the selected nutrition requirements\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-8.5\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays that no mix qualifies and does not show an enabled save action for a qualifying mix\",\n     \"when\": \"The manager views the optimization result\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"The feedlot web app shall let authorized ration managers create, revise, optimize, and approve ration definitions, display ingredient proportions, nutrition and cost values, and present the lowest-cost candidate mix meeting user-selected nutritional requirements without saving it until the user chooses to do so.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-8\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-4\",\n    \"ASM-5\",\n    \"ASM-6\",\n    \"ASM-20\",\n    \"ASM-29\",\n    \"Q-6\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An authorized planner selects a date, pen, bunk rate, ration, and animal count\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-9.1\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The plan request contains those selected values and the screen displays the returned plan's date, pen, assigned lot or lots, animal count, ration, planned quantity, planned time, quantity per animal, total feed cost, expected energy intake, and status\",\n     \"when\": \"The planner submits the plan\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A user lacks planning access and opens feed planning\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-9.2\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays existing plans without plan-generation or plan-adjustment actions\",\n     \"whe