ins calculated values\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-11.2\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays actual-minus-planned variance, feed cost, energy value, inventory consumed by ingredient, and cumulative lot feed consumption and cost\",\n     \"when\": \"The event screen renders the response\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A successful feeding response contains planned quantity of 100 pounds, actual delivered quantity of 115 pounds, and a returned variance value of 15 pounds\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-11.3\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays the returned variance value of 15 pounds\",\n     \"when\": \"The event screen renders the response\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A feeding response includes actual delivered quantity and an inventory movement\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-11.4\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays stock consumption for the delivered quantity and known wastage as a separate movement rather than added delivered feed\",\n     \"when\": \"The event screen renders the response\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"The service refuses a feeding event because available stock is insufficient\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-11.5\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays the returned stock error and does not display the event as saved\",\n     \"when\": \"The user submits the event\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A user without operational access opens feeding activity\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-11.6\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays existing activity without an action to record a feeding event\",\n     \"when\": \"The screen renders\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A feeding-event save request times out without a definitive response\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-11.7\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays that the save outcome is unknown, retains the submitted event fields, and disables resubmission until the user refreshes the activity list\",\n     \"when\": \"The web app handles the timeout\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A save timed out and the user refreshes the activity list, which returns an event matching the submitted feeding date, pen, lot allocations, ration, planned quantity, delivered quantity, and status\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-11.8\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays the returned matching event and sends no duplicate save request\",\n     \"when\": \"The refreshed list is displayed\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A save timed out and the user refreshes the activity list, which returns no event matching the submitted feeding date, pen, lot allocations, ration, planned quantity, delivered quantity, and status\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-11.9\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays that no matching saved event was returned and enables the user to submit the retained event\",\n     \"when\": \"The refreshed list is displayed\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A user has returned permission to correct or void saved feeding events\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-11.10\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen shows correction and void actions\",\n     \"when\": \"The user opens a saved feeding event\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A user lacks returned permission to correct or void saved feeding events\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-11.11\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays the event without enabled correction or void actions\",\n     \"when\": \"The user opens a saved feeding event\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An authorized user submits a correction and the service returns the corrected event with updated inventory movement and lot totals\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-11.12\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays the returned corrected event, inventory movement, and lot consumption and cost totals\",\n     \"when\": \"The correction response is displayed\"\n  